  "name": "Sequence Midtones Transfer Function (seqmtf)",
  "category": [
    "stretch-color",
    "stretch-transforms"
  ],
  "description": "Same command as MTF but for the sequence sequencename .\n\nThe output sequence name starts with the prefix \"mtf_\" unless otherwise specified with -prefix= option\n\nLinks: mtf\n\nUses fixed input references and writes only invocation-owned outputs. Optional argument values are sent only when their use_* control is true; zero is preserved.",
